because I can't put the pieces together,

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.360
that if you've consumed
what I've had to say

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:44.050
on the ridiculous, thank God,
success that it's brought me

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.640
and any other company that does it,

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:49.080
my friends, the number one
advertiser on Google AdWords

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:52.090
from 2001 to 2008 was Amazon.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:55.340
Amazon became the biggest
company in our country

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.680
because it understood
under priced attention

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.460
and it didn't buy billboard,

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:00.550
I mean, it bought a lot of things

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:01.460
'cause it was a big company,

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:04.970
but they spent crazy
money on Google AdWords

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:07.640
when Google AdWords
was the best arbitrage.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:10.560
I took a liquor store that
was doing $3 million a year

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:15.330
