00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.740
or a podcast that they can then record

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:02.450
and then after it's done for an hour,

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:04.630
do what I do which is post-produce it

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.930
